Package: postgresql-@PG_MAJOR@-pgokf
Version: @DEB_VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Section: database
Priority: optional
Depends: postgresql-@PG_MAJOR@, libc6
Homepage: @HOMEPAGE@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Description: @SYNOPSIS@
 pgokf materializes Open Knowledge Format (OKF) bundles -- directories of
 UTF-8 Markdown concept documents with YAML frontmatter -- into a
 transactional, queryable PostgreSQL catalog with native full-text search
 and link-graph traversal. The on-disk bundle stays the portable source of
 truth; PostgreSQL becomes a projection optimized for metadata queries.
 .
 This package contains the pgokf extension built for PostgreSQL @PG_MAJOR@.
 After installation, run "CREATE EXTENSION pgokf;" in a database on a
 PostgreSQL @PG_MAJOR@ cluster.
